# Bezier Curve Outline — a chessboard square that, when tapped, springs along
# a cubic Bezier path (sampled per point on the UI thread via
# ContourMeasureIter) while growing 64 -> 180; "Outline Mode" (hold blurs the
# screen, release cross-fades) reveals the path with 4 draggable control
# points, and the square follows the edited curve.
# What this test covers: run the square to the end and back; reverse it
# mid-flight; enter outline mode and drag every control point (incl. to the
# screen edges and onto each other, collapsing the curve), leave outline
# mode and run the square along the edited path; a held Outline Mode press
# (blur in/out); rapid outline toggles; and a run interrupted by a toggle.
# Initial points: start (140,674), c1 (302,574), c2 (302,300), end (200,200).
context platform=ios
open "demos://animations/bezier-curve-outline"
wait 2000
wait "label=\"Close\"" 30000
wait "label=\"Outline Mode\"" 30000
wait 1000
# Square: start -> end, end -> start.
press 140 674
wait 2200
press 200 200
wait 2200
# Reverse mid-flight.
press 140 674
wait 600
press 220 450
wait 2200
# Outline mode: drag the control points.
press "label=\"Outline Mode\""
wait 1200
gesture pan 302 574 -150 50 800
wait 400
gesture pan 302 300 -250 100 800
wait 400
gesture pan 200 200 150 -60 800
wait 400
gesture pan 140 674 200 100 800
wait 400
# Collapse: drag c1 onto the start point.
gesture pan 152 624 188 150 800
wait 400
# Back to the square and run it along the edited curve.
press "label=\"Outline Mode\""
wait 1500
press 340 774
wait 2200
press 350 140
wait 2200
# Outline again, restore a sensible curve.
press "label=\"Outline Mode\""
wait 1200
gesture pan 340 774 -200 -100 800
wait 400
gesture pan 340 774 -40 -200 800
wait 400
press "label=\"Outline Mode\""
wait 1500
# Held press: blur in, release toggles.
longpress 201 817 1200
wait 1200
longpress 201 817 1200
wait 1200
# Run the square and toggle mid-flight.
press 140 674
wait 400
press "label=\"Outline Mode\""
wait 300
press "label=\"Outline Mode\""
wait 300
press "label=\"Outline Mode\""
wait 1500
wait "label=\"Close\"" 15000
press "role=\"button\" label=\"Close\""
wait 1500
